android/build/ 是 Gradle 自己的临时产物（reports/problems 等）。
真正的构建输出已被 android/build.gradle.kts 重定向到仓库根的 build/，
后者本来就在 .gitignore 里。
---
 .gitignore | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index f71c585e..531189d3 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -64,3 +64,12 @@ coverage/
 
 # temp files for fdroid pubspec.lock
 /tmpfdroid/
+
+# Golden test failure images (generated by flutter test when a golden differs)
+/test/failures/
+
+# Delivered build artifacts (apk/md copied here for easy access)
+/dist/
+
+# Gradle's own scratch output inside android/ (the real build dir is /build/)
+/android/build/
